[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4178954473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118100#issuecomment-4178954473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118100","id":4178954473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75Fcjp","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T16:14:38Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:14:38Z","body":"With the above commit, the issue where pressing \"y\" even when typing the name for a file has been fixed","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4178954473/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188780448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118100#issuecomment-4188780448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118100","id":4188780448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75q7eg","user":{"login":"Hedwig7s","id":51961150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTYxMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51961150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s","html_url":"https://github.com/Hedwig7s","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hedwig7s/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T12:00:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T12:00:59Z","body":"Maybe not so much for confirmation prompts but I feel this is both non-standard and potentially problematic especially for file picker prompts\r\nIf the user expects an input prompt they might start typing and expect that to be auto highlighted, but with this they might accidentally trigger a potentially destructive action\r\n\r\nI would suggest one or more of the following (I am unsure of the current implementation so these might already be the case):\r\n\r\n- Auto-select yes action in confirmation prompts and file name in file selection prompts with enter confirming the action and esc cancelling or denying\r\n- Select specific buttons based on the first (or first non conflicting) letter. E.g. in a yes, no, cancel prompt you can select the buttons via Y, N and C respectively and trigger them with enter, optionally with Ctrl+Key or Alt+Key to instantly trigger the action. Also doable in file prompts as long as the user has tabbed to a text button\r\n- By default map these actions to Ctrl+Y/Ctrl+N (potentially with Ctrl+C or Ctrl+A for cancel/abort as well, although a bit conflicted with copy/select all) and allow users to rebind this if they'd prefer a singular key ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188780448/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189297107","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118100#issuecomment-4189297107","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118100","id":4189297107,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75s5nT","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T18:13:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T18:13:49Z","body":"Based on some feedback that I got from many people elsewhere, it sounds like people do want to require \"alt\" by default in case they start typing somewhere (either because they didn't know the confirmation box would come up, or if they thought a text box was selected). \r\n\r\nAs a separate idea that could be in a proposal, with changes like this where some people want it one way and others want a different way, maybe there could be a wizard that goes through all these kinds of \"users are split down the middle\" options.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1157\" height=\"127\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/731b946d-3353-4fca-866e-17cacc9df658\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189297107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4189475980","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118100#issuecomment-4189475980","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118100","id":4189475980,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75tlSM","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_eve