os","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T18:38:41Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T13:20:55Z","body":"@Calinou \r\n> Some feedback:\r\n> \r\n> * In this dialog, I can press Y for **Select** which is good, but pressing N does nothing (I would expect it to choose **Cancel**):\r\n> \r\n> <img alt=\"Image\" width=\"555\" height=\"154\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/180032/573318069-0bf1858f-33cb-4a6f-9f03-086a024866ec.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzU0OTk1ODIsIm5iZiI6MTc3NTQ5OTI4MiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xODAwMzIvNTczMzE4MDY5LTBiZjE4NThmLTMzY2ItNGE2Zi05ZjAzLTA4NmEwMjQ4NjZlYy5wbmc_.MjsJqrcjMXVttinKbN7Ih0iLw5fJTBsx-Hx7NWSHgzY\">\r\n\r\n\r\nThis might also be confusing for users that in some dialogs, the negative option hotkey presses \"cancel\", while in others it does things like discard changes. For cancel, \"ui_close_dialog\" should be used","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4194250246/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4200134847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118100#issuecomment-4200134847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118100","id":4200134847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76WPi_","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T15:23:33Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T15:23:33Z","body":"I updated the default hotkeys to require holding alt as well","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4200134847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4202997767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118100#issuecomment-4202997767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118100","id":4202997767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76hKgH","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T00:24:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T00:24:47Z","body":"There are a few cases that are unclear how the shortcuts should line up:\r\n- Some dialogs only have two options, like \"yes\" and \"cancel\" (1 positive, 1 negative).\r\n- Some have \"Save changes\", \"discard changes\", and \"cancel\" (1 positive, 2 negative).\r\n- Some (like when selecting the main scene) have \"select\", \"select current\", and \"cancel\" (2 positive, 1 negative)\r\n\r\nShould the negative option button work for cancel when there is only one negative option? And should the case where there are 2 positives just not have a key for the second positive option?\r\n\r\nAnother change that some users have asked for is showing the keybind as part of the button text.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4202997767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]